1
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:10,245
From home, the mountain was no bigger than a grain of rice.

2
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:14,885
The rain taught me to walk slower.

3
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:21,318
Some evenings, it waited for me in a window.

4
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:26,157
Then the sea stood up between us.

5
00:00:34,400 --> 00:00:37,813
The mountain never moved. Only I did.
